    s = s & "<p><strong>Outer end beam (d&#305;&#351; enleme, 2026-11-03u):</strong> the cast-in-place beam beyond the girder ends (1-2" & vbLf
    s = s & "<code>G_DIS_ENLEME_KALINLIGI</code> 0.475 / <code>_YUKSEKLIGI</code> 2.15 / <code>_BOYU</code> 10.5 m) is section 15 <code>DIS_ENLEME</code>, a plain" & vbLf
    s = s & "rectangle hanging from the deck top (offset CT), slab concrete, cast with the deck (CS2), full torsion (no" & vbLf
